        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions AP-CRS100012SWVSBR, Austrian Crystal Bling Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bling Appliance Pull is filled with Austrian Crystals for a truly beautiful look. The picture really doesn't do the beauty of the sparkling Austrian Crystals justice. Choose from 12 inch, 18 inch, and 24 inch packaged with hardware to mount on an appliance panel. The acrylic is manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading; this ultra clear acrylic allows the Austrian Crystals to show their shimmering beauty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the First Impressions AP-CRS100012SWVSBR Contemporary Austrian Crystal Acrylic Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear Acrylic filled with Austrian Crystals</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>These Refrigerator pulls are supplied with countersunk screws for mounting to 3/4\" - 1\" thick panels (standard appliance panel thickness).</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-ATL05-specifications.pdf?v=1704262300\"><b>First Impressions AP-CRS100012SWVSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-CRS100012SWVSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-CRS100018SWVSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 16-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-CRS100024SWVSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 22-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This appliance handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 3 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the appliance handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
